  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DialogueText: 'What a cute piece!<n>

    But... well... it seems to be all fluff
    and no substance.<n>

    You might try to make this one work, but I don''t know
    if it can actually be of any use.<n>

    Sorry, pal.'
